      "writtenOn": "2019-05-08T16:35:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With this setting change, prochot will be asserted anytime VSYS is at VSYS_MIN. When the battery voltage is below VSYS_MIN, then PPVAR_VYSY will be regulated at VSYS_MIN, similar to when no battery is present. The charger is operating in precharge mode at this point and its bat FET acts like a linear regulator.",
